      "writtenOn": "2026-11-10T16:42:09Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "previously, once the host has been powered on once, `fruDetails.powerIsOn \u003d true`.\n\nSo any match on `powerMatch` would call `eventHandler` and then trigger `rescanBusses(busMap, fruDetails, objServer);`, meaning a rescan would occur even when the host is powered off.\n\nWith this change `fruDetails.powerIsOn` is updated accurately but there is no rescan when the host is powered off.\n\nShould we rescan in that case too? Since some eeproms could become unavailable.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1582,
        "startChar": 16,
        "endLine": 1591,
        "endChar": 17
      },
      "revId": "a8fa03fcdf8f3a85a8d12ca1575ba9e1d3f5835a",
